<!-- WinSparkle appcast for Take a Joke (Windows direct download).
     The app checks this file for updates (feed URL is set in-app to the
     raw.githubusercontent.com URL of this file). Each release prepends an
     <item>: sparkle:version must match the 1.0.<CI run number> stamped into
     the exe's version resources (WinSparkle's comparison key), and the
     enclosure points at the VERSIONED installer asset on the taj-windows
     release (the stable-named TakeAJoke-Windows-Setup.exe asset is for the
     landing page, not this feed). length = exact byte size. No EdDSA
     signature yet — the exe embeds no WinSparkle public key, so trust is
     HTTPS-only until code signing lands.
     See take-a-joke/ref/windows.md for the full release recipe. -->
