    <item>
      <title>Take a Joke 1.0.13</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>First self-updating Windows release. Fixes the round-1 timer
        running under the narrated intro, keeps phones from ghost-ending
        rounds in abandoned games, and makes the live connection heal
        itself. The app now keeps itself up to date.</p>
